         "'Hero Tower' is a game without regular monsters where you directly face challenging bosses. Dodge the boss's attacks through rolling and jumping, and seize the opportunity to counter-attack. It tests players' reflexes, stamina management, and insight into the boss's moves.",
         "'Hero Tower' is a game without regular monsters where you directly challenge bosses. We have meticulously designed 13 unique bosses, each with its own distinct fighting style. Enjoy seamless and responsive 2D controls: evade attacks with rolls and jumps, while finding opportunities to strike back at enemies. Both attacking and rolling consume stamina, so it's crucial to manage your stamina wisely. ",
