         "Simple and satisfying! Unwind your mind with this new brain training puzzle action game!",
         "The controls are easy! Two buttons to turn the world, roll the ball and hit the switch! How to play: Press the button to turn the stage. ◆ Stages Over 200 stages! From simple ones to absolute brain busters, there are tons of challenges to take on! ◆ Balls Earn points by clearing stages. Use those points to unlock a variety of balls to use. ◆ Create In this mode, you can build your own stage. Make something fun for your family and friends to try! ◆ Battle Battle with up to four players! The person who can clear the various stages fastest wins. Finish as fast as you can in this five-set match!",
         "The controls are easy! Two buttons to turn the world, roll the ball and hit the switch! How to play: Press the button to turn the stage. ◆ Stages Over 200 stages! From simple ones to absolute brain busters, there are tons of challenges to take on! ◆ Balls Earn points by clearing stages. Use those points to unlock a variety of balls to use. ◆ Create In this mode, you can build your own stage. Make something fun for your family and friends to try! ◆ Battle Battle with up to four players! The person who can clear the various stages fastest wins. Finish as fast as you can in this five-set match!",
